d patterns:\n  - `dashed` (bool): Enables or disables dashed rendering.\n  - `dash_length` (float): Specifies the length of each dash.\n  - `gap_length` (float): Specifies the gap between dashes.\n  \n- Implement a helper method `_compute_dashed_segments()` that processes the original polyline into segments based on the dash and gap lengths.\n  \n- Update the `_draw()` method to:\n  - Check for the `dashed` flag.\n  - Use the new helper function to generate dash segments.\n  - Build and combine geometry for each dash segment.\n  \n- Bind the new properties in `_bind_methods()` so that they are exposed to the scripting API and editor.\n  \n- Ensure that the non-dashed mode continues to function as before.\n\nThis commit adds flexible support for dashed/dotted line rendering, improving the visual customization of the Line2D node.\n","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-02-07T01:12:47Z","updated_at":"2025-02-07T18:31:26Z","closed_at":"2025-02-07T12:43:26Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"239